	5. CRASH REPORTING: Firebase Crashlytics
	   - Anonymous crash data only ✓
	   - Detailed in Privacy Policy Section 2.4 ✓
	
	6. DATA PRIVACY: Compliant with GDPR & CCPA
	   - Privacy Policy available in app ✓
	   - Terms of Service available in app ✓
	   - Data minimization practiced ✓
	
	All requirements met for App Store submission ✓
	-->

